				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Greetings,
<br />

<br />
I'd like to be considered as a potential Pm for a spot on the Anthem Roster.  I'm an East Coast raider, but my schedule enables me to raid during the day as opposed to the evening hours.  I have a couple of good friends in Anthem at the moment and have grouped with a number of people in past occasions.  From my exposure to Anthem as a Guild, ya'll appear to be a tight knit family that I would wish to be a part of.  I'm very interested, and hope to meet the criteria.  
<br />

<br />
My character is a 65 Frog Shaman by the name of Spyf.  
<br />

<br />
At the present time I have 90 AA's, many of which include the important shaman AA's (MGB, Canni V, ND3, Reinforcement Mastery, SCM, RC....just to name a few).   
<br />

<br />
My spell book is also complete at the moment (excluding Primal Essence, and my last LDoN spell). 
<br />

<br />
I have recently completed my Emp SSRA key, and am LP Rift to complete my VT key.  
<br />

<br />
I have two insta click items, one outdoor use only, the other indoor use.  
<br />

<br />
My Flags are slightly limited however.  I am flagged to mee the normal requirements but not much further.  Presntly I am actively trying to backflag to pick up the few i need to be sol ro flagged (Zek's, Mith Marr, and Bert).  Hopefully i can sneak on a few raids and put those flags behind me.  
<br />

<br />
Eamy has agreed to be my sponsor.  
<br />

<br />
That's pretty much it.  I've been trying to tag along on Anthem raids as I get the free time, and I hope to more often in the next few days.  
<br />

<br />
Until our paths meet, may you have many safe travels...
<br />
Spyf Stythys
<br />

